## 证据 6：TX CIC (校验和插入) 的设置

**发包入口判断是否需要** — [stmmac_main.c:3354](stmmac_main.c#L3354):
```c
csum_insertion = (skb->ip_summed == CHECKSUM_PARTIAL);
```

**写入描述符** — [norm_desc.c:195-198](norm_desc.c#L195):
```c
if (likely(csum_flag))
    tdes1 |= (TX_CIC_FULL) << TDES1_CHECKSUM_INSERTION_SHIFT;
    // TX_CIC_FULL = 3 → bits[28:27] = 0b11
    // 含义：硬件计算 IP 头校验和 + TCP/UDP 伪头 + payload 校验和
else
    tdes1 &= ~(TX_CIC_FULL << TDES1_CHECKSUM_INSERTION_SHIFT);
```

